vachanas.translation:
My feet are the foundation stones of the temple;
My limbs are its carved pillars;
My arms are the serpent pedestal;
My bones are the encircling framework;
My lips are the inner doorway;
The Guru's grace is the Liṅga;
My body is the central sanctum;
My heart-lotus is the act of worship;
My ears are the *Kīrtimukha*;
My remembrance is the bell upon my tongue;
My head is the golden finial;
My eyes are unfailing lamps;
My skin is the pure covering;
My remembrance of You is the offering of food;
Thus abides Mallayya of Gurupura!
